  m_text: "So\u2026 you really thought you could challenge the one true Collector?\n\nI
    may have left your little collection in a bit of a mess.\nPutting all of this
    back together should keep you busy for a while.\nA very, very long while.\n\nOf
    course, it would be much easier if you had my talents.\nYou don\u2019t have any
    magical collecting abilities, do you?\n\u2026Do you?\n\nGood luck."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd545f561cbc8bf43992ab019bf4d988, type: 2}
